(i)(ii)(iii)(iv)(v)(vi)(4)(i)(1)(v)(F) (F) A description of method procedure, method validation information and rationale for selecting each test method;
(i)(ii)(iii)(iv)(v)(vi)(4)(i)(1)(v)(G) (G) The name and location of the testing laboratory or laboratories and documentation showing that the laboratory or laboratories is (or are) accredited by a nationally or internationally recognized external accreditation organization;
(i)(ii)(iii)(iv)(v)(vi)(4)(i)(1)(v)(H) (H) Length of time between dates of manufacture and date(s) of testing;
