(i)(ii)(iii)(iv)(v)(vi)(4)(i)(2)(v) (v) Fermentation process. For smokeless tobacco products and tobacco products that contain fermented tobacco (including naturally fermented tobacco), information on the fermentation process, including the following:
(i)(ii)(iii)(iv)(v)(vi)(4)(i)(2)(v)(A) (A) Description of the fermentation process;
