(i)(ii)(iii)(iv)(v)(vi)(4)(i)(2)(vi) (vi) Heat treatment process. For tobacco products that are heat treated, the application must contain the following information regarding the heat treatment process:
(i)(ii)(iii)(iv)(v)(vi)(4)(i)(2)(vi)(A) (A) Description of the heat treatment process;
(i)(ii)(iii)(iv)(v)(vi)(4)(i)(2)(vi)(B) (B) Type of heat treatment;
