(i)(ii)(iii) (iii) The impact the product and its marketing will have on the likelihood of tobacco use initiation by tobacco product nonusers;
(i)(ii)(iii)(iv) (iv) How users and nonusers perceive the risk of the tobacco product based upon its label, labeling, and advertising, to the extent that advertising has been studied;
