(i)(ii)(iii)(iv)(v)(vi)(4)(i)(1)(v)(E) (E) The number of samples and measurement replicates for each sample;
(i)(ii)(iii)(iv)(v)(vi)(4)(i)(1)(v)(F) (F) A description of method procedure, method validation information and rationale for selecting each test method;
